      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hello!  Upon further investigation this is intended by design.  It was implemented so that players cannot harass the people that blocked them with objects.  The correct behavior should be that while the pickup is held by a blocked user the renderers and colliders are disabled on the object, upon dropping it will re-enable the affected components.  I will be closing this post out.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
